        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift, Thompson\n- Songs: \"Ronan\"\n- Tours: The 1989 World Tour\n- Events: Stand Up to Cancer, Glendale, Arizona stop\n- Places: Glendale, Arizona\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Swift first performed the song \"Ronan\" live for Stand Up to Cancer in September 2012.\n- The 1989 World Tour was the fourth concert tour by American singer-songwriter Taylor Swift.\n- The 1989 World Tour supported Taylor Swift's fifth studio album, \"1989\" (2014).\n- Taylor Swift has performed \"Ronan\" publicly only one other time, at the Glendale, Arizona stop of The 1989 World Tour.\n- Thompson was in attendance at the Glendale, Arizona stop of The 1989 World Tour where Taylor Swift performed \"Ronan\".",
